### 数据库监控API测试文件
### 支持新版本三参数报警格式 (receiver, auth, content)

### 1. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. 检查所有数据源
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/check/all
Accept: application/json

### 3. 检查特定数据源
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/check/main-db
Accept: application/json

### 4. 获取监控状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/status
Accept: application/json

### 5. 获取详细状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/status/detailed
Accept: application/json

### 6. 获取综合状态（包括系统健康）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/status/comprehensive
Accept: application/json

### 7. 系统健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/system-health
Accept: application/json

###
### === 新版本报警系统测试 ===
###

### 8. 测试三参数报警接口 (receiver, auth, content)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/alert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiver": "test-alerts",
  "auth": "test_token_12345",
  "content": "这是一条测试报警消息，用于验证新的三参数格式"
}

### 9. 获取报警配置信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/alert-config
Accept: application/json

### 10. 获取报警账号使用统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/alert-usage
Accept: application/json

### 11. 测试INFO级别报警
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-alert/info
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. 测试WARN级别报警
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-alert/warn?message=这是一条警告级别的测试消息
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. 测试ERROR级别报警
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-alert/error?message=这是一条错误级别的测试消息
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. 重置每日使用次数 (仅测试用)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/reset-daily-usage
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. 标准Webhook接收测试 (模拟外部报警系统)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiver": "info-alerts",
  "auth": "info_token_12345",
  "content": "🟢 数据库连接恢复通知\n数据库: main-db\n状态: 连接已恢复\n时间: 2024-01-20 15:30:00\n检查耗时: 120ms"
}

### 16. 数据库断开测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-db-disconnect
Content-Type: application/json

### 17. 数据库重连测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/test-db-reconnect
Content-Type: application/json

### 18. 手动触发定时报告
POST http://localhost:8080/api/test/trigger-scheduled-report
Content-Type: application/json

### 19. 获取定时报告配置信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/scheduled-report-info
Accept: application/json

